{"animath":"0.1","canvas":{"height":540,"width":960},"kind":"concept","level":"primary","scenes":[{"caption":"Two rectangles make one L","duration_ms":9000,"id":"s1","narration":"This L-shape is not one rectangle — it is two rectangles joined together. Break it apart, and area and perimeter become easy.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"q","kind":"text","size":44,"text":"Area and perimeter of an L-shape","x":120,"y":90}},{"at_ms":600,"do":"show","shape":{"fill":"#7fb3e8","h":120,"id":"partA","kind":"rect","stroke":"#1a1a1a","strokeWidth":2,"w":200,"x":120,"y":180}},{"at_ms":1400,"do":"show","shape":{"fill":"#8fd694","h":140,"id":"partB","kind":"rect","stroke":"#1a1a1a","strokeWidth":2,"w":120,"x":120,"y":300}},{"at_ms":2200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"labA","kind":"text","size":30,"text":"part A: 200 by 120","x":520,"y":230}},{"at_ms":2600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"labB","kind":"text","size":30,"text":"part B: 120 by 140","x":520,"y":300}},{"at_ms":3600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"areaA","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"A = 200 × 120 = 24 000","x":520,"y":390}},{"at_ms":4600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"areaB","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"B = 120 × 140 = 16 800","x":520,"y":450}},{"at_ms":5600,"do":"emphasize","dur_ms":1000,"target":"areaA"},{"at_ms":7000,"do":"caption","text":"Split the shape before you measure it"}]},{"caption":"Trace the edge for the perimeter","duration_ms":11000,"id":"s2","narration":"The perimeter is the walk around the edge. Watch the arrows trace every side — including the two inner steps of the L — then add them all.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"q","kind":"text","size":40,"text":"Walk around the whole edge","x":120,"y":90}},{"at_ms":500,"do":"show","shape":{"fill":"#e9e4d6","h":120,"id":"shapeA","kind":"rect","stroke":"#1a1a1a","strokeWidth":2,"w":200,"x":120,"y":180}},{"at_ms":700,"do":"show","shape":{"fill":"#e9e4d6","h":140,"id":"shapeB","kind":"rect","stroke":"#1a1a1a","strokeWidth":2,"w":120,"x":120,"y":